"values": [{
"args": [true],
"method": &"black"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": ["Chapter 2", "Base Camp", "", 3.8],
"method": &"card"
}, {
"args": [1.4],
"method": &"fade_in"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": [NodePath("Cam_02_TheBaseCamp")],
"method": &"cut_to"
}, {
"args": ["(The ground is still shaking. If that was the rock rising... no boat is coming for me.)", 5.75],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["(Find out what happened here. Find Elias.)", 3.5],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": [],
"method": &"hide_note"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": ["Supply Manifest", "SUPPLY MANIFEST — BASE CAMP → UPPER STATION
CARGO CAR 2 — LOADING ORDER

Rations (14 days) ........ 6 crates
Diesel ........ 4 drums
Medical ........ 2 crates
Sample cases (sealed) ........ DOWN ONLY

All personnel transfers to the Research Center by car only.
The mountain road is CLOSED.

— in pencil —
Car 1 never came back down.", 7.5],
"method": &"show_note"
}, {
"args": [NodePath("Cam_03_TheSupplyYard_B")],
"method": &"cut_to"
}, {
"args": ["(Rations. Diesel. Medical. All of it stamped for the upper station. This whole camp just feeds something up the mountain.)", 6.0],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": [],
"method": &"hide_note"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": ["(A cable car. The line goes up into the fog... all the way to the top.)", 4.95],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": [NodePath("Cam_04_TheCableCarStation_B")],
"method": &"cut_to"
}, {
"args": ["Drive switch clicks — nothing", 1.5],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["(Dead. Everything here must run off that substation.)", 4.050000000000001],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": [],
"method": &"hide_note"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": ["(The tank's bone dry. There might be fuel in the barracks.)", 4.35],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["Hollow clank — empty tank", 2.0],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": [],
"method": &"hide_note"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": [],
"method": &"hide_note"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": ["Locker — Elias", "A folded jacket. A paperback with the cover torn off. His dog tags hang from the hook.

    ELIAS
    SVC NO. 30-118-2749
    O NEG

Tucked behind the tags is a photograph: the two of you on the harbor wall back home. On the back, in his handwriting:

\"If you're reading this, you came anyway. I'm sorry.\"", 7.0],
"method": &"show_note"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": ["Picks up the fuel can", 2.0],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["(Fuel. Heavy. Now back to the generator.)", 3.45],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": ["BANG — the barracks door", 2.0],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["(Footsteps. Something's at the door. HIDE.)", 3.55],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": [true],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": ["Locker door clicks shut, metal creaks (inside the locker)", 2.5],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["Slow footsteps on concrete", 2.5],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["Footsteps — closer", 2.5],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["Breathing through the locker vents", 2.5],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": ["Fuel glugs into the tank", 2.0],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": [NodePath("Cam_10_FuellingTheGenerator_B")],
"method": &"cut_to"
}, {
"args": ["(That's all of it. Now the starter cord.)", 1.0],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["Cord pull — engine sputters, dies", 1.6],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["(Come on...)", 2.5],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["Cord pull — sputters, dies", 1.6],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["(Come ON.)", 2.5],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["Cord pull — the engine CATCHES and runs", 3.0],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["(It's running. Now the breakers. Carefully.)", 3.6],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": ["Restart Procedure", "SUBSTATION B — RESTART PROCEDURE

1. Fuel and start the generator. (Pull the cord. She may take a few tries.)
2. LIGHTING before COMMS. Comms draws off the lighting bus.
3. MAIN goes LAST. Always. Main first and she trips the lot.

— in pencil, underneath —
and don't let her trip. it hears the bang.", 8.5],
"method": &"show_note"
}, {
"args": ["SPARKS — a loud BANG (it can hear that)", 2.5],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["(It tripped everything. And that bang was LOUD. Anything out there heard it.)", 5.25],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["Clunk", 0.8],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["Clunk", 0.8],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["Clunk", 0.8],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["Power hums up across the camp — the station lights come on", 3.0],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["(Power. The cable car should run now.)", 3.3],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": ["(It's lit. It works.)", 2.5],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": [NodePath("Cam_12_BackToTheStation_B")],
"method": &"cut_to"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": ["SGT. ELIAS (INTERCOM): ...if anyone's still on this frequency. This is Sergeant Elias, Detachment 9.", 5.0],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["SGT. ELIAS (INTERCOM): I'm at the upper station. The research center. What's left of the survey team made it up here with me.", 6.0],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["SGT. ELIAS (INTERCOM): The camp isn't safe. It came up out of the water, and it walks the yard every night.", 5.5],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["SGT. ELIAS (INTERCOM): I sent car one back down for anyone still alive. Nobody came.", 4.5],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["SGT. ELIAS (INTERCOM): If you're hearing this, whoever you are: do not follow me. And if it calls you by name, don't answer.", 6.0],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["SGT. ELIAS (INTERCOM): ...[static]... it's on the line. It's climbing the line—", 4.0],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["Static. Then nothing.", 2.0],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": [NodePath("Cam_14_TheCableCar_B")],
"method": &"cut_to"
}, {
"args": ["RUN lever — the drive motor starts winding up (it needs time)", 3.0],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["(Come on...)", 2.5],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["A wail from the yard", 2.0],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["Running footsteps — coming fast", 3.0],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["(Come ON.)", 2.5],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["CLUNK — the grip bites, the car lurches out", 2.0],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["It slams into the platform rail", 2.0],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["(Moving. It's moving.)", 2.5],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["(It's standing where I was. Watching me go up.)", 3.75],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": [1.5],
"method": &"fade_out"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": ["", "End of Chapter 2", "Chapter 3 — The Line.  To be continued…", 6.8],
"method": &"card"
}]
}
